<node id="&quot;EXISTING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal contract outlining terms between parties, including definitions related to termination dates and amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Departing Bank’s Commitment and Revolving Credit Commitment under the Existing Credit Agreement immediately prior to giving effect to this Amendment shall be terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Credit Agreement is referenced as the prior agreement that is being amended by Amendment No. 2 and includes prior terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the previously executed credit agreement that is being modified by the Amendment."</data>
